WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.859
This one runs over three days.

2
00:00:04.242 --> 00:00:05.732
From your brand's home,

3
00:00:05.732 --> 00:00:09.401
tap plus, choose Create event,

4
00:00:09.474 --> 00:00:11.256
then Ticketed event.

5
00:00:11.847 --> 00:00:14.366
Step one is the same as any event:

6
00:00:14.395 --> 00:00:16.311
a name, the format

7
00:00:16.317 --> 00:00:17.633
and a party type,

8
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.313
then your vibe tags and genres.

9
00:00:21.034 --> 00:00:22.332
Use the description

10
00:00:22.332 --> 00:00:24.265
to say how the days work.

11
00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.639
Step two: when.

12
00:00:28.842 --> 00:00:30.746
Choose Multi-date,

13
00:00:30.746 --> 00:00:32.580
and add each day with its

14
00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.453
own start and end.

15
00:00:35.364 --> 00:00:36.754
Once there are two,

16
00:00:36.754 --> 00:00:39.401
Mingla asks how guests pay.

17
00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:42.180
Per day means a guest buys

18
00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.485
a pass for each day they choose.

19
00:00:44.961 --> 00:00:47.204
Add as many days as you need

20
00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.827
Sunday here starts in the afternoon.

21
00:00:50.538 --> 00:00:51.744
Three dates,

22
00:00:51.744 --> 00:00:52.850
one event.

23
00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:02.800
Step three: where.

24
00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:04.394
Name the venue,

25
00:01:04.451 --> 00:01:07.273
then search for the address and pick it.

26
00:01:07.899 --> 00:01:09.538
With hide address on,

27
00:01:09.538 --> 00:01:12.432
only people with a ticket see where it is.

28
00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:18.381
Step four is how it looks.

29
00:01:18.577 --> 00:01:20.491
Add a video cover.

30
00:01:20.876 --> 00:01:22.239
Once it's uploaded,

31
00:01:22.239 --> 00:01:24.447
close the sheet and keep going

32
00:01:24.474 --> 00:01:26.929
Mingla gets it ready in the background.

33
00:01:27.498 --> 00:01:29.544
Set the theme while you wait:

34
00:01:29.643 --> 00:01:31.917
a blue, a typeface,

35
00:01:31.986 --> 00:01:33.509
and a little glitter.

36
00:01:33.737 --> 00:01:36.465
The preview changes with every choice.

37
00:01:37.409 --> 00:01:39.811
Come back, and the cover is ready.

38
00:01:52.447 --> 00:01:54.836
Step five: tickets.

39
00:01:55.085 --> 00:01:57.535
Name it, and tell guests they can

40
00:01:57.535 --> 00:01:59.387
pick their nights at checkout.

41
00:01:59.751 --> 00:02:01.789
Because you chose per day,

42
00:02:01.798 --> 00:02:04.777
the price is for one day, in dollars.

43
00:02:05.238 --> 00:02:06.485
Set how many,

44
00:02:06.485 --> 00:02:08.041
turn on the waitlist,

45
00:02:08.089 --> 00:02:09.596
allow transfers,

46
00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:10.782
and save.

47
00:02:17.047 --> 00:02:18.348
Step six:

48
00:02:18.348 --> 00:02:21.062
keep it public, with transfers on.

49
00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:23.934
And turn on in-person payments

50
00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:25.244
if you'll sell at the door.

51
00:02:26.747 --> 00:02:28.008
Step seven.

52
00:02:28.052 --> 00:02:31.138
The forecast gives you a likely turnout

53
00:02:31.196 --> 00:02:33.799
a band, not a promise.

54
00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:36.173
The preview shows your page

55
00:02:36.173 --> 00:02:38.226
the way a guest sees it.

56
00:02:38.527 --> 00:02:40.842
Each date has its own box.

57
00:02:41.053 --> 00:02:43.186
Tick Friday and Saturday,

58
00:02:43.201 --> 00:02:45.555
and because it's priced per day,

59
00:02:45.555 --> 00:02:47.943
the total is two passes.

60
00:02:48.637 --> 00:02:50.693
Publish, and all three

61
00:02:50.693 --> 00:02:52.425
dates go on sale at once.

62
00:03:01.413 --> 00:03:03.007
And it's live.

63
00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:05.490
One page for the whole weekend,

64
00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.289
with every date on it.

65
00:03:07.989 --> 00:03:10.131
Every customer Mingla drives

66
00:03:10.131 --> 00:03:12.431
your way lands right here.
